# ── Generated output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# All of the following are gitignored, so CI's fresh checkout never sees them and `format:check`
# there is unaffected. They are listed for the DEVELOPER running the same command locally: after an
# Android build and a Python test run, `pnpm format:check` reported 154 failures in generated files
# and 38 in real ones, which made the command useless for finding the 38 that matter.
#
# `format:check` passes `--ignore-path .prettierignore` explicitly, which REPLACES prettier 3's
# default of [.gitignore, .prettierignore] — so being gitignored is not enough on its own, and each
# generated path has to be repeated here.
#
# CMake/NDK output from `expo run:android` — compile_commands.json, .cmake/api replies, prefab config.
apps/mobile/android/**/.cxx/
# pytest's cache directory (README.md + nodeids) in every Python service.
**/.pytest_cache/
# Python virtualenvs in the services that have one — site-packages ships other projects'
# LICENSE.md and dist-info JSON, which this command would otherwise report as ours.
**/.venv/
**/venv/
